 swimming pool, there is also a gym with high-end equipment, treadmills, baths and saunas, common areas for business meetings and events, a children's pool. The convenient location provides fast and convenient communication with various destinations and infrastructure facilities. The Al Ain Road connecting to the main areas of Dubai is located nearby, Meydan Racetrack is just a 5-minute drive away, and the road to Downtown Dubai and the Dubai Hills Estate Mall and Dubai International Airport takes about 15 minutes.","price":null,"title":"Tonino Lamborghini Residences","bitrix":{"id":716,"pf_id":"are.3.10304","source":null,"project_id":"Meydan Business Park","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Tonino Lamborghini Residences","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Gulf Land Property Developers","project_location":"Meydan"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Lamborghini_Residences_cfd3faafc2.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Lamborghini_Residences_cfd3faafc2.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.1616375,"lng":55.3243871},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Tonino_Lamborghini_Residences_by_Gulf_Land_Property_Developers_in_Meydan_Nad_Al_Sheba_1_for_Sale_b39ac4a7eb.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Tonino_Lamborghini_Residences_by_Gulf_Land_Property_Developers_in_Meydan_Nad_Al_Sheba_1_for_Sale_b39ac4a7eb.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Tonino_Lamborghini_Residences_by_Gulf_Land_Property_Developers_in_Meydan_Nad_Al_Sheba_1_for_Sale_c47633e617.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Tonino_Lamborghini_Residences_by_Gulf_Land_Property_Developers_in_Meydan_Nad_Al_Sheba_1_for_Sale_c47633e617.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Tonino_Lamborghini_Residences_by_Gulf_Land_Property_Developers_in_Meydan_Nad_Al_Sheba_1_for_Sale_cb14